 "structural_change": "flat lane-slice (22,816 sinks on one clock root; three routes missed hold) split into hardened leaves with their own roots under a wires-only parent: 4 FP32 lane leaves, 3 xl relay leaves, 1 pass-through relay leaf, 1 output-stage leaf and the core (ces0 14,519 / cesn 13,919 sinks); one seam latency LSEAM in all four slices (lockstep asserted); every seam is leaf flop -> wire -> leaf flop; remove the shared parent clock spine: ten face entries each drive one hard-child clock pin, die delivers phi-R_i at each entry",
 "child_clock_ref": "boundary",
